  "description": "Aunt Yunjung had always protected Sanghun since he was a child. Then one day, with the news of his aunt's marriage, he moved to Seoul. Time passed, and Sanghun became a university student. As he pondered where to spend his vacation, news of his aunt, whom he hadn't seen in a long time, reached him. Sanghun arrived at his aunt's house with excitement and anticipation. His aunt, who opened the door and came out, was wrapped in only a shower towel, looking at Sanghun and welcoming him happily...\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/3587013647), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13893465), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/aunts_embrace), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/comic/C000077011), [Toptoon](https://toptoon.com/comic/ep_list/my_aunts_arms?p_id=pp_1601_001), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/uplmscg/episode/toon/9157) \n\n**Official Translations:**   \n[Japanese](https://www.toptoon.jp/product/129973)",
